sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant API as ASP.NET Core API
  participant DB as SQL Server
  User->>UI: Register or sign in
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/register or /login
  API->>DB: Read or create user and role
  DB-->>API: Account and password hash
  API->>API: Verify password and issue JWT on login
  API-->>UI: User role and token or safe error
  UI->>UI: Route to user or staff workspace
  UI->>API: Request protected resource with JWT
  API->>DB: Confirm active user and authorized role
  API-->>UI: Authorized data or 401/403
